{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_193_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_193","textTraditional":"一、十有二年，春，齊高偃帥師納北燕伯於陽。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_193_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_193","textTraditional":"納者，內不受也。燕伯之不名何也？不以高偃挈燕伯也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_193_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_193","textTraditional":"二、三月，壬申，鄭伯嘉卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_193_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_193","textTraditional":"三、夏，宋公使華定來聘。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_193_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_193","textTraditional":"四、公如晉，至河乃還。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_193_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_193","textTraditional":"季孫氏不使遂乎晉也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_193_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_193","textTraditional":"五、五月，葬鄭簡公。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_193_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_193","textTraditional":"六、楚殺其大夫成虎。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_193_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_193","textTraditional":"七、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_193_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_193","textTraditional":"八、冬，十月，公子憖出奔齊。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_193_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_193","textTraditional":"九、楚子伐徐。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_193_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_193","textTraditional":"十、晉伐鮮虞。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_193_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_193","textTraditional":"其曰晉，狄之也。其狄之何也？不正其與夷狄交伐中國，故狄稱之也。","sentenceOrder":13}],"overrides":{}}